@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User
component "Web / HTTP adapter" as Web
component "Resource Catalogue\napplication use cases" as App
component "Resource Catalogue\ndomain" as Domain
component "Authority admission port" as AuthPort
component "Authority Management adapter" as Auth
component "Resource Catalogue\nrepository port" as RepoPort
database "PostgreSQL adapter" as Pg
component "Owner-preserving\nread projection/composition" as Read

User --> Web
Web --> App
App --> Domain
App --> AuthPort
AuthPort --> Auth
App --> RepoPort
RepoPort --> Pg
App --> Read
Read --> Domain

note right of Web
Outer adapter only.
No Resource Catalogue semantic ownership.
Caller does not choose trusted actor,
authority scope or provenance.
end note

note right of AuthPort
Application-owned dependency boundary.
RC domain does not depend on Authority
Management implementation or HTTP.
end note

note bottom of Read
Cross-context enrichment may compose
presentation data without moving
semantic ownership into Web/query code.
end note

@enduml